,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":null},{"game_id":5,"givenby":"Great Britain Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":1,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":9,"comments":null},{"game_id":6,"givenby":"Hong Kong, China Open","cat1":2,"cat2":1,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":9,"comments":"Felt there was still too much pushing in the play and stepping into/onto feet in running lanes. Congratulations on the win, throws in the wind were too good "},{"game_id":120,"givenby":"People's Republic of China Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":1,"total":9,"comments":"56#bad attitude .no line up. Unfriendly communication with us"},{"game_id":118,"givenby":"Chinese Taipei Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":3,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":11,"comments":null},{"game_id":119,"givenby":"New Zealand Open","cat1":3,"cat2":2,"cat3":3,"cat4":2,"cat5":3,"total":13,"comments":null},{"game_id":164,"givenby":"Colombia Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":"Thanks for a great game Austria. We felt that you heard when we asked you to reduce the physicality, and you had a very good communication throughout the game. We encourage you to keep it up, and be careful with the dangerous plays (1). We also want to address the situation when your player wasn’t sure if he caught the goal (4-7). Maybe when in doubt, the player who’s not sure might ask to go to the video because no other player had a perspective. Best of lucks and thanks again!"},{"game_id":187,"givenby":"Singapore Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":2,"total":11,"comments":null},{"game_id":189,"givenby":"France Open","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":3,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":11,"comments":"Some living examples of fair-mindedness when Austrian players were able to retract their call, following the guidance of the sideline, their own teammates or even after a moment of breathing, from themselves !\r\nThanks again !"},{"game_id":193,"givenby":"Italy Open","cat1":3,"cat2":1,"cat3":2,"cat4":1,"cat5":1,"total":8,"comments":null}],"spiritstats":{"games":10},"spirittotal":{"total":101}}